<section class="orders section-pad" id="order">
  <div class="container orders-grid">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">Online Orders</div>
      <h2>Place your order from anywhere. We'll call within 24 hours.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Choose a build, tell us your specs, and our floor manager will confirm timeline and pricing before anything touches the bay.</p>
      <div class="order-steps">
        <div><div class="num">1</div><div><strong>Submit your build sheet</strong><span>Vehicle, budget, and the look you're after.</span></div></div>
        <div><div class="num">2</div><div><strong>Get a confirmed quote</strong><span>Our team responds within one business day.</span></div></div>
        <div><div class="num">3</div><div><strong>Drop off or door-to-door pickup</strong><span>We collect the car or bike from your address.</span></div></div>
        <div><div class="num">4</div><div><strong>Track the build</strong><span>Photo updates from the bay until delivery day.</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <form class="order-form reveal" onsubmit="return handleOrderSubmit(event)">
      <h3>Request a Build Sheet</h3>
      <p class="sub">No payment needed yet — this just starts your quote.</p>
      <div class="form-row">
        <div class="form-field"><label for="fname">Full Name</label><input id="fname" type="text" placeholder="Jane Wanjiru" required></div>
        <div class="form-field"><label for="fphone">Phone</label><input id="fphone" type="tel" placeholder="07xx xxx xxx" required></div>
        <div class="form-field full"><label for="femail">Email</label><input id="femail" type="email" placeholder="you@email.com" required></div>
        <div class="form-field full"><label for="fvehicle">Vehicle Type</label>
          <select id="fvehicle">
            <option>Custom BMW</option>
            <option>Mercedes</option>
            <option>Motorcycle</option>
            <option>Other / Not sure yet</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="form-field full"><label for="fnotes">Tell us about the build</label><textarea id="fnotes" rows="3" placeholder="Colours, finish, timeline..."></textarea></div>
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">
        Submit Order Request
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      </button>
      <p class="form-note">By submitting, you agree to be contacted by the Naimas team about your build.</p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="faq section-pad" id="faq">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">Good To Know</div>
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <p>The questions we hear most before a build sheet gets submitted.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-wrap">
      <div class="faq-item reveal">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><h4>How long does a custom build take?</h4><span class="faq-icon"></span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>Detail and refresh work is usually done in 48 hours. Full custom builds typically run 2–6 weeks depending on parts availability, and Signature One-Off builds are scoped individually with your build manager.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><h4>Do you work on cars other than BMW and Mercedes?</h4><span class="faq-icon"></span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>Yes — BMW and Mercedes are our specialty bays, but our general floor and fabrication bay take on other makes and all motorcycles. Mention your vehicle in the build sheet and we'll confirm.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><h4>Can I order online without visiting first?</h4><span class="faq-icon"></span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>Absolutely. Submit your build sheet online, and we'll confirm the quote and timeline by phone or email. Many customers only see the car in person on delivery day.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><h4>Do you offer financing or payment plans?</h4><span class="faq-icon"></span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>Yes, custom builds over $5,000 can be split into milestone payments — deposit, mid-build, and delivery. Details are confirmed in your quote.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal">
        <button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><h4>What warranty comes with a custom build?</h4><span class="faq-icon"></span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>Paint work carries a 5-year warranty, interior re-trims carry 3 years, and all mechanical work is covered for 12 months or 20,000 km, whichever comes first.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="contact section-pad" id="contact">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">Reach The Floor</div>
      <h2>Contact Information</h2>
      <p>Come see a build in progress, or reach out before you submit your order.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-grid">
      <div class="contact-card reveal">
